T12:31:36.501173Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":4},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"What's happening: Your courier (requests) goes to https://example.com, knocks on the server's door, and says, \"Hey, can I have the HTML code for this page?\" * The server hands it over, and you store that entire digital package inside a variable called page.\nWhat's happening: You take the raw HTML text (page.text) and hand it to BeautifulSoup.\n\nThe \"html.parser\" part is just telling Python: \"Hey, treat this like standard website code, map out the structure, and make it searchable.\" Now, the variable soup holds a neatly organized version of the website.\nWhat's happening: You are telling your organized soup: \"Find the HTML element called <title>, and just give me the plain human text inside it.\"\n\nIf the website's code looks like <title>Example Domain</title>, this line will simply print: Example Domain.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"page=requests.get(\"https://margaretwambui.co.ke/\")\nsoup=BeautifulSoup(page.text,\"html.parser\")\nprint(soup.title.text)","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-06-26T12:34:35.190637Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-06-26T12:34:35.191055Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-06-26T12:34:36.514947Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-06-26T12:34:35.191023Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-06-26T12:34:36.514092Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Professional Web Designer in Kenya | Margaret Wambui – Creative Developer & Designer\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":8},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"*⚠ 6. Important Note About Web Scraping*  \nAlways:  \n✔ Read website policies  \n✔ Respect rate limits  \n✔ Avoid excessive requests  \n✔ Use scraping responsibly  \nSome websites prohibit automated scraping.\n","metadata":{}}]}